830441_1084964457661429_5791265303751373453_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4137JD9nyAcQ7kNvwESDB3J&_nc_oc=AdpugbUW_dttv23lPgYYXJ79cZRRSPE0tI1ThQYfEr8B_xPSTTDM6Nagrt8lv_Ig_Ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQsQysi3URQRo0SEghkICu37hj6CxL4mt_0KLV4AP3ylw&oe=6B04537B"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1371566178136543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/793139181_1371566181469876_772737679900740954_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3UmQ_mPCapQQ7kNvwFoajfU&_nc_oc=AdpcddNB-JvXHzmX5LRcGprhyiwq4UsJFK_VDh3GjvHLEFssZQvWals6Z6XU4Hk2XF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ3XHCbmdaoEbE04I7G2VYhlFORPPkogQuKhWo-4N-Ihg&oe=6B047580"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1756098462126690", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604347072_1756098465460023_1018908953880571156_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=meqZekdoKj0Q7kNvwHtH7FE&_nc_oc=AdqY2C_qBbjofTz3B1oGDjoLM9Fmd9NG3BeHVbzgVQ-eXHizYNG5LDbw1rAoBoDXWY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDnd-N6XuxaUwDbfq52MZ2xojhwhLuO9eShxWe9Y-BIg&oe=6B047848"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1633144218195167", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1633144221528500_6050571958921125258_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i3g3cyOK-1cQ7kNvwHxRDAK&_nc_oc=AdqrWrcCXPyhuydepV_KZRjCsgDM57Fwn7Ni9XWOiAnI0xBziinCUvEqBcdEH-Ze6hM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQK49hpLdMsPSn5S0jEXk-YDqwDzqbvj-5YSVU6w3aShw&oe=6B046090"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1113974211181531", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673531334_1113974214514864_4053371199100276452_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4yU5mV0ZJJEQ7kNvwEAfD83&_nc_oc=AdpcW6IZPSzLu0rA61bAMjOhZ00YLq4O9qlqsU7mTC9p1_lRMt_oTbfftThYkih-sOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRALYOr0JNGyNBXMJs3rj9-4NQFIdANNlQ6jLqlgMenPQ&oe=6B047F6B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games", "keywords": ["Horror", "Scary", "Haunted", "Zombie", "granny"], "long_description": "Welcome to Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games, a VR experience that\u2019ll keep you on the edge of your seat! You\u2019ve got one goal: escape the haunted room before the creepy inhabitants get to you. Solve puzzles, avoid terrifying creatures, and make it out alive.\n\nIn Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games, you\u2019ll encounter some seriously spooky characters\u2014like a Zombie Dog, a dead Joker, and even an eerie Mummy. Each challenge will test your nerves and your puzzle-solving skills. The best part? You can play it alone or with a friend!\n\nThe game offers two modes:\n- Solo Mode: It\u2019s just you against the haunted room\u2014get out before it\u2019s too late!\n- Co-op Mode: Work with a friend to help each other escape. Can you both survive?\n\nKey Features:\n- Play solo or team up in co-op mode.\n- Face off against creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, a Zombie Dog, and more.\n- High-quality VR graphics for an immersive, hair-raising experience.\n- Puzzles that challenge your brain while keeping your heart racing.\n- Exclusively available on Oculus Quest.", "short_description": "Get ready for a spooky adventure in Horror Story VR - Granny Horror Games! You\u2019re trapped in a haunted room, and it\u2019s up to you to find a way out. Face creepy creatures like Granny, Ghosts, and even a Zombie Dog. Whether you're going solo or teaming up with a friend, every moment counts!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/futlixgames/privacy-policy/meta-oculus-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futlix G